  "description": "Final Fantasy Tactics USA (SCUS-94221) PSXRecomp setup project for Windows, Linux and macOS, with OpenBIOS, modern controllers and optional 16:9.",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/NJH-1001/FinFanTacRecomp",
  "rom_identity": {
    "crc32": [
      "377f6510"
    ],
